1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
I just watched a BBC documentary
about autism in Africa.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
It's called Life on the Spectrum.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,500
There's one scene...
I can't unsee.

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,000
A boy. A room. A locked door.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Not because anyone hated him.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
His family just had no one
who understood.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
In most of Africa, less than ten
percent ever get a diagnosis.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Watch it. Share it.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Don't look away.
